+     * intervening read-then-later-write gap, resolve_context() is called
+     * exactly once per use case — that single resolution already satisfies
+     * the "authorization must be resolved immediately before mutation"
+     * requirement (H1C-A2's TOCTOU contract is about a caller that reads
